<title>THAILAND: Thai Aug C/A deficit narrows to 29.3 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Aug C/A deficit narrows to 29.3 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's August current account deficit narrowed to a preliminary 29.3 billion baht from a revised 31.0 billion baht deficit in July, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Aug 96     July 96	   Aug 95</p>
<p>				 29.3	 31.0		 31.3</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
